      "type": "content",
      "title": "🍇 三大紅葡萄品種",
      "content": "<div class=\"grape-trio\"><div class=\"grape-box king\"><div class=\"grape-badge\">👑 王者</div><h3>Nebbiolo</h3><div class=\"grape-profile\"><p><strong>🎨 顏色：</strong>寶石紅，邊緣磚紅或橙色</p><p><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>玫瑰、紫羅蘭、焦油、皮革、松露</p><p><strong>👅 口感：</strong>高單寧、高酸度、酒體飽滿</p><p><strong>⏱️ 陳年：</strong>10-30 年</p><p><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Barolo, Barbaresco</p></div></div><div class=\"grape-box popular\"><div class=\"grape-badge\">⭐ 親民</div><h3>Barbera</h3><div class=\"grape-profile\"><p><strong>🎨 顏色：</strong>深紫紅色</p><p><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、甘草、紫羅蘭</p><p><strong>👅 口感：</strong>低單寧、高酸度、清爽</p><p><strong>⏱️ 陳年：</strong>2-8 年</p><p><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Barbera d'Asti, Barbera d'Alba</p></div></div><div class=\"grape-box easy\"><div class=\"grape-badge\">🍷 日常</div><h3>Dolcetto</h3><div class=\"grape-profile\"><p><strong>🎨 顏色：</strong>深紫色</p><p><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>紅色水果、杏仁、草本</p><p><strong>👅 口感：</strong>中等單寧、低酸度、果香</p><p><strong>⏱️ 陳年：</strong>1-5 年</p><p><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Dolcetto d'Alba</p></div></div></div>"
