      "content": "<div class=\"white-wines\"><div class=\"white-wine-card gavi\"><h3>🥂 Gavi DOCG</h3><div class=\"wine-info\"><p><strong>品種：</strong>Cortese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、礦物感、檸檬、青蘋果</p><p><strong>酸度：</strong>高</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>海鮮、白肉、沙拉、Vitello Tonnato</p><p><strong>適飲期：</strong>1-5 年</p></div></div><div class=\"white-wine-card moscato\"><h3>🍾 Moscato d'Asti DOCG</h3><div class=\"wine-info\"><p><strong>品種：</strong>Moscato Bianco</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>微甜氣泡、桃子、荔枝、玫瑰花香</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>低（5-6.5%）</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>甜點、水果、早午餐</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>清新、低壓氣泡（Frizzante）</p></div></div><div class=\"white-wine-card asti\"><h3>🎉 Asti DOCG</h3><div class=\"wine-info\"><p><strong>品種：</strong>Moscato Bianco</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>甜型氣泡酒、花香濃郁</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>6-9%</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>蛋糕、Panettone、慶祝場合</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>充分氣泡（Spumante）</p></div></div></div>"
